<title>USA: Escalon names CEO.</title>
<headline>Escalon names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SKILLMAN, N.J. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Escalon Medical Corp said Tuesday Richard DePiano had been named board chairman and chief executive..</p>
<p>Sterling Johnson, currently president and CEO has been named to the vacant chief operating officer post while retaining the presidency position and giving up the chief executive slot .</p>
<p>Jay Federman has resigned his position as chairman but remains on the board, the company said.</p>
<p>DePiano  is currently chief executive of the venture capital firm  The Sandhurst Co LP, Escalon said.</p>
